{"4848890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "State Breakers", "steam_appid": 4848890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a while, everything was brilliant. Interstate A.I. had automated all jobs and unified all governments. Mindex brain implants made people smarter, freer and happier than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could possibly go wrong, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We don’t know why - not yet - but a few years back, Interstate turned on us. They infected all Mindex users with some kind of computer-brain virus. Overnight, the whole population went insane. We call those people zombies now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only real humans left are those who never got the chip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We live in hiding. We communicate secretly. We trade. We collaborate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are The Resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there’s only one way to hit our clanker overlords where it hurts…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/1134e373c1cc7fcc738128bdb5e3a55f.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/1134e373c1cc7fcc738128bdb5e3a55f.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/1134e373c1cc7fcc738128bdb5e3a55f.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/2bc1dd392e6427711e7cbd80263ea875.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/64c7787c2719a79e6071c134269a5988.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/64c7787c2719a79e6071c134269a5988.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/64c7787c2719a79e6071c134269a5988.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; A raid a day keeps the overlords away.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interstate data centers are vast techno-industrial mazes - plagued with zombies, guarded by clankers, and raided by other humans just like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter solo or with a team. Explore. Loot weapons, items, and Interstate API credit currency. Fight to survive, collaborate when it benefits you, and extract before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/c4e621c3570e25208065a0e6ca62879f.avif?t=1788297249\" width=934 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/45cd911a810c56bfb44f1d9cc8a2e392.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/45cd911a810c56bfb44f1d9cc8a2e392.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/45cd911a810c56bfb44f1d9cc8a2e392.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; The best firefights are the ones you’ve rigged beforehand.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend API credits at Interstate consoles to manipulate the map in real time: Lock doors before enemies can flee to them. Disable extraction points. Cut the lights. Electrify entire sectors. Restock loot crates. Mine credits. Trigger facility-wide events. And much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain multiple hacks together, set custom delays, and create your own unique tactical chaos. Master these console actions to increase your chances of survival, and to ruin your opponents’ day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/87e677dc3d10f93088884de4cbfb93ab.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/679ddf2f29344eb24c1e72a1a0c9ed6b.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/679ddf2f29344eb24c1e72a1a0c9ed6b.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/679ddf2f29344eb24c1e72a1a0c9ed6b.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; The enemy of my enemy is my friend. Unless they’re also trying to kill me.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are infiltrating as a solo, duo, trio or squad, The Resistance strongly encourages cooperation with other humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unhelpfully, Interstate maintains a public ELO skill ranking for each solo, and team combination, perhaps in an attempt to plant the seeds of human vs human violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be very careful who you trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate and cooperate - or lie, betray, kill, rob, and gain Interstate ranking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/babded9e2be16986e00afc055fec9881.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/4b463ffc89fd1b1ab4d7939b109349d3.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/4b463ffc89fd1b1ab4d7939b109349d3.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/4b463ffc89fd1b1ab4d7939b109349d3.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; They took our jobs. Now let’s take theirs.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress in your resistance journey, you will come across Level Up tokens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to increase your Interstate API clearance level, gain access to new map areas, unlock new console actions, and assign yourself powerful biohack skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the highest-level infiltrators can run a data center self-destruct sequence. Trigger one, then run like hell, and you’ll become a resistance legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/715787c4fc9e67227d87b5120aacaf7a.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/c469f7f6c161afbfc58917ab2673bfad.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/c469f7f6c161afbfc58917ab2673bfad.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/c469f7f6c161afbfc58917ab2673bfad.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; Sometimes, it’s not good to ask too many questions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interstate may reach out to you offering missions. Please note that The Resistance does not endorse participation in these errands, as we are unclear on Interstate’s real motivations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonetheless, completing Interstate missions can earn you bonus API credits and other rare rewards - and may even help us to uncover more information about what really happened to Interstate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: there are penalties for failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/1d55088bb12a29038ac6894774429818.avif?t=1788297249\" width=934 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/68675d709aae0638edbf2d85e6ec5564.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/68675d709aae0638edbf2d85e6ec5564.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/68675d709aae0638edbf2d85e6ec5564.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; The resistance runs on courage, sacrifice, and online shopping.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bunker is your safe haven between infiltrations, and a place to keep looted items safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the retro-tech nerds at <i>_gap</i> have furnished your bunker with a computer and a secure connection to the underground web, which you can use to buy and sell weapons and items, accept missions, and keep up to date with The Resistance’s efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock advanced weapons, gadgets, and tactical charm items as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/4d4ac4edf40c6710773bda83c986ad07.avif?t=1788297249\" width=935 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/db3af9692eddfa34fdc85d53e9321d00.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/db3af9692eddfa34fdc85d53e9321d00.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/db3af9692eddfa34fdc85d53e9321d00.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; Interstate spent billions developing military A.I. We bought a jukebox.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every battle is won with bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun clankers with giant QR codes. Force zombie hordes to dance by blasting music at them. Hide from enemies inside cardboard boxes. Capture enemies with Interstate Portacell tech, and deploy them against hostile humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Resistance is constantly researching and developing innovative and effective new tools, gadgets, and combat techniques. Master them to stay alive longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/578e9bd2dadefc05234db198b56eaaf4.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/5b249dde8a04ec7e00a5fe931b7f5751.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/5b249dde8a04ec7e00a5fe931b7f5751.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/5b249dde8a04ec7e00a5fe931b7f5751.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; Leave them on read.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interstate is always watching. As you progress, they are likely to start sending you messages. The Resistance strongly discourages listening to these communications. We have lost good fighters to the A.I.’s manipulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/9c220e87c2fd0fea645b6a79f247517c.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This orientation document has been authored by _gap_0001, with collaboration from _gap and the international Treelight Resistance factions, collectively The Resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No A.I. was used in the making of this orientation document. Please fully consider the relevant risks before joining us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trees become the forest. You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a while, everything was brilliant. Interstate A.I. had automated all jobs and unified all governments. Mindex brain implants made people smarter, freer and happier than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could possibly go wrong, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We don’t know why - not yet - but a few years back, Interstate turned on us. They infected all Mindex users with some kind of computer-brain virus. Overnight, the whole population went insane. We call those people zombies now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only real humans left are those who never got the chip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We live in hiding. We communicate secretly. We trade. We collaborate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are The Resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there’s only one way to hit our clanker overlords where it hurts…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/1134e373c1cc7fcc738128bdb5e3a55f.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/1134e373c1cc7fcc738128bdb5e3a55f.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/1134e373c1cc7fcc738128bdb5e3a55f.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/2bc1dd392e6427711e7cbd80263ea875.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/64c7787c2719a79e6071c134269a5988.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/64c7787c2719a79e6071c134269a5988.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/64c7787c2719a79e6071c134269a5988.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; A raid a day keeps the overlords away.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interstate data centers are vast techno-industrial mazes - plagued with zombies, guarded by clankers, and raided by other humans just like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter solo or with a team. Explore. Loot weapons, items, and Interstate API credit currency. Fight to survive, collaborate when it benefits you, and extract before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/c4e621c3570e25208065a0e6ca62879f.avif?t=1788297249\" width=934 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/45cd911a810c56bfb44f1d9cc8a2e392.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/45cd911a810c56bfb44f1d9cc8a2e392.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/45cd911a810c56bfb44f1d9cc8a2e392.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; The best firefights are the ones you’ve rigged beforehand.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend API credits at Interstate consoles to manipulate the map in real time: Lock doors before enemies can flee to them. Disable extraction points. Cut the lights. Electrify entire sectors. Restock loot crates. Mine credits. Trigger facility-wide events. And much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain multiple hacks together, set custom delays, and create your own unique tactical chaos. Master these console actions to increase your chances of survival, and to ruin your opponents’ day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/87e677dc3d10f93088884de4cbfb93ab.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/679ddf2f29344eb24c1e72a1a0c9ed6b.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/679ddf2f29344eb24c1e72a1a0c9ed6b.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/679ddf2f29344eb24c1e72a1a0c9ed6b.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; The enemy of my enemy is my friend. Unless they’re also trying to kill me.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are infiltrating as a solo, duo, trio or squad, The Resistance strongly encourages cooperation with other humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unhelpfully, Interstate maintains a public ELO skill ranking for each solo, and team combination, perhaps in an attempt to plant the seeds of human vs human violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be very careful who you trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate and cooperate - or lie, betray, kill, rob, and gain Interstate ranking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/babded9e2be16986e00afc055fec9881.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/4b463ffc89fd1b1ab4d7939b109349d3.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/4b463ffc89fd1b1ab4d7939b109349d3.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/4b463ffc89fd1b1ab4d7939b109349d3.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; They took our jobs. Now let’s take theirs.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress in your resistance journey, you will come across Level Up tokens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to increase your Interstate API clearance level, gain access to new map areas, unlock new console actions, and assign yourself powerful biohack skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the highest-level infiltrators can run a data center self-destruct sequence. Trigger one, then run like hell, and you’ll become a resistance legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/715787c4fc9e67227d87b5120aacaf7a.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/c469f7f6c161afbfc58917ab2673bfad.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/c469f7f6c161afbfc58917ab2673bfad.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/c469f7f6c161afbfc58917ab2673bfad.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; Sometimes, it’s not good to ask too many questions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interstate may reach out to you offering missions. Please note that The Resistance does not endorse participation in these errands, as we are unclear on Interstate’s real motivations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonetheless, completing Interstate missions can earn you bonus API credits and other rare rewards - and may even help us to uncover more information about what really happened to Interstate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: there are penalties for failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/1d55088bb12a29038ac6894774429818.avif?t=1788297249\" width=934 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/68675d709aae0638edbf2d85e6ec5564.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/68675d709aae0638edbf2d85e6ec5564.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/68675d709aae0638edbf2d85e6ec5564.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; The resistance runs on courage, sacrifice, and online shopping.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bunker is your safe haven between infiltrations, and a place to keep looted items safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the retro-tech nerds at <i>_gap</i> have furnished your bunker with a computer and a secure connection to the underground web, which you can use to buy and sell weapons and items, accept missions, and keep up to date with The Resistance’s efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock advanced weapons, gadgets, and tactical charm items as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/4d4ac4edf40c6710773bda83c986ad07.avif?t=1788297249\" width=935 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/db3af9692eddfa34fdc85d53e9321d00.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/db3af9692eddfa34fdc85d53e9321d00.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/db3af9692eddfa34fdc85d53e9321d00.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; Interstate spent billions developing military A.I. We bought a jukebox.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every battle is won with bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun clankers with giant QR codes. Force zombie hordes to dance by blasting music at them. Hide from enemies inside cardboard boxes. Capture enemies with Interstate Portacell tech, and deploy them against hostile humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Resistance is constantly researching and developing innovative and effective new tools, gadgets, and combat techniques. Master them to stay alive longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/578e9bd2dadefc05234db198b56eaaf4.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/5b249dde8a04ec7e00a5fe931b7f5751.poster.avif?t=1788297249\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/5b249dde8a04ec7e00a5fe931b7f5751.webm?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/5b249dde8a04ec7e00a5fe931b7f5751.mp4?t=1788297249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; Leave them on read.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interstate is always watching. As you progress, they are likely to start sending you messages. The Resistance strongly discourages listening to these communications. We have lost good fighters to the A.I.’s manipulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/extras/9c220e87c2fd0fea645b6a79f247517c.avif?t=1788297249\" width=936 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This orientation document has been authored by _gap_0001, with collaboration from _gap and the international Treelight Resistance factions, collectively The Resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No A.I. was used in the making of this orientation document. Please fully consider the relevant risks before joining us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trees become the forest. You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "State Breakers is a chaotic top-down PvPvE extraction shooter. INTERSTATE A.I. has turned against humanity! They must be infiltrated and destroyed! Resist solo or in a team - kill zombies, hack the map, outwit rival humans, loot, level up - and overthrow the clanker scum!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/6703ef9834e77ab72e9f1d77814355164a18f7ed/header.jpg?t=1788297249", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/ca176ea63d1edcb82c2a8ef36280934091c7640b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788297249", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/ca176ea63d1edcb82c2a8ef36280934091c7640b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788297249", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "©  Symbol Door Limited. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Symbol Door"], "publishers": ["Symbol Door"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 70, "description": "Surround Sound"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/a15fbbd4a4116ff056bbcbaec221afa945813678/ss_a15fbbd4a4116ff056bbcbaec221afa945813678.600x338.jpg?t=1788297249", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/a15fbbd4a4116ff056bbcbaec221afa945813678/ss_a15fbbd4a4116ff056bbcbaec221afa945813678.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788297249"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/820bc6a45c25ca3cfd32c6100783b825bbd46e37/ss_820bc6a45c25ca3cfd32c6100783b825bbd46e37.600x338.jpg?t=1788297249", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/820bc6a45c25ca3cfd32c6100783b825bbd46e37/ss_820bc6a45c25ca3cfd32c6100783b825bbd46e37.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788297249"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/f04a86edbb77cccdca0a7bf4de70c5641feb1d14/ss_f04a86edbb77cccdca0a7bf4de70c5641feb1d14.600x338.jpg?t=1788297249", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/f04a86edbb77cccdca0a7bf4de70c5641feb1d14/ss_f04a86edbb77cccdca0a7bf4de70c5641feb1d14.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788297249"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/b51302ca2670ff1ac985209d6f815fb4c76bdfe2/ss_b51302ca2670ff1ac985209d6f815fb4c76bdfe2.600x338.jpg?t=1788297249", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/b51302ca2670ff1ac985209d6f815fb4c76bdfe2/ss_b51302ca2670ff1ac985209d6f815fb4c76bdfe2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788297249"}, {"id": 4, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/44b764592dce24a5785b6306cae66e3bdf3f3071/ss_44b764592dce24a5785b6306cae66e3bdf3f3071.600x338.jpg?t=1788297249", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/44b764592dce24a5785b6306cae66e3bdf3f3071/ss_44b764592dce24a5785b6306cae66e3bdf3f3071.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788297249"}, {"id": 5, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/6cac62683adfa8f5ca0a639d7f92607a925358a9/ss_6cac62683adfa8f5ca0a639d7f92607a925358a9.600x338.jpg?t=1788297249", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/6cac62683adfa8f5ca0a639d7f92607a925358a9/ss_6cac62683adfa8f5ca0a639d7f92607a925358a9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788297249"}, {"id": 6, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4848890/6547bf